            "text": "Hi team, I've uploaded the first draft of the 'Clinician Educational Slide Deck' to A2, which is the main part of T2. It covers the mechanism of action, clinical data, and safety profile. I've sourced all claims, but would appreciate your feedback on the flow and clarity from a sales perspective before it goes for regulatory review.",
