            "speaker_id": 63661,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks @70832, this looks very thorough. The data on slides 8-10 is powerful. I'd suggest we add a summary slide at the beginning with the top 3 key takeaways for busy clinicians. To align with this, I've drafted the 'Standard Sales Script and Objection Guide' (A3) for T3. It mirrors the key messages from your deck. Let me know your thoughts.",
