            "text": "Team, moving on to T4 and T7. I've created a draft 'Digital Outreach Plan' in A4. It proposes using targeted LinkedIn posts and a 3-part email series to engage HCPs. I've also outlined three potential webinar topics aimed at our Tier 1 accounts. Please provide your feedback.",
