            "text": "I agree. My experience in digital marketing for pharma suggests a targeted approach is better than a broad one. We need to be where the clinical conversations are happening. So, we'll stick with LinkedIn and email for now. Decision: The pilot will use LinkedIn and email as the primary digital channels.",
