            "speaker_id": 63661,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, let's align on tracking for the pilot. I've created two documents: A6 is the 'KPI Tracking Dashboard Template' for T6, and A8 is the proposed 'CRM Logging Process' for T10. Please review and share your feedback so we can ensure consistent data collection.",
