            "speaker_id": 70832,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Thanks for putting these together. In A6, the KPI 'Lead' is a bit broad. Could we define it more clearly? For example, does attending a webinar count as a lead, or only a direct request for information? Having clear definitions will be critical for the post-pilot report.",
