          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 70832,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, the initial 21-day pilot is complete. Thank you for all your hard work. I've compiled the 'Post-Pilot Performance and Lessons Report' draft in A7, which summarizes the data from our KPI tracker A6. This covers T11. Overall, engagement was higher than benchmarked, and lead generation in Tier 1 accounts was particularly strong. Please review the report and share your thoughts.",
            "mentions": [
